17/09/2026 04:24:16 PM | INFO     | step_4.py:<module>:158 - Docs: [Document(id='dd0765cb-aad0-4eab-97ea-9f6b4a523808', metadata={'subject': '(unspecified)', 'total_pages': 4, 'author': '(anonymous)', 'moddate': '2026-02-14T13:10:37+00:00', 'title': '(anonymous)', 'trapped': '/False', 'source': 'D:\\AI\\RAG\\11_self_rag\\documents\\Product_and_Pricing.pdf', 'page': 2, 'keywords': '', 'creationdate': '2026-02-14T13:10:37+00:00', 'creator': '(unspecified)', 'producer': 'ReportLab PDF Library - www.reportlab.com', 'page_label': '3'}, page_content='Pricing & Plans\nNexaAI pricing is based on the number of active users and selected product modules. All plans\ninclude standard security updates and product enhancements.\nStarter Plan\nDesigned for small teams and early-stage adoption.\n\x7f\nPrice: ■2,499 per user per month\n\x7f\nAccess to NexaChat core features\n\x7f\nUp to 5,000 queries per month\n\x7f\nEmail-based customer support\n\x7f\nShared cloud infrastructure\nGrowth Plan\nBest suited for growing teams requiring deeper insights and integrations.\n\x7f\nPrice: ■5,999 per user per month\n\x7f\nAccess to NexaChat, NexaInsight, and NexaSupport\n\x7f'), Document(id='e10e515a-c569-4aa8-a637-be263f6f3dd2', metadata={'creationdate': '2026-02-14T13:10:37+00:00', 'subject': '(unspecified)', 'page_label': '3', 'title': '(anonymous)', 'creator': '(unspecified)', 'total_pages': 4, 'keywords': '', 'page': 2, 'trapped': '/False', 'producer': 'ReportLab PDF Library - www.reportlab.com', 'moddate': '2026-02-14T13:10:37+00:00', 'source': 'D:\\AI\\RAG\\11_self_rag\\documents\\Product_and_Pricing.pdf', 'author': '(anonymous)'}, page_content='\x7f\nPrice: ■5,999 per user per month\n\x7f\nAccess to NexaChat, NexaInsight, and NexaSupport\n\x7f\nAdvanced analytics and reporting\n\x7f\nThird-party integrations (Slack, CRM, BI tools)\n\x7f\nPriority email and chat support\nEnterprise Plan\nTailored for large organizations with strict security, compliance, and scalability requirements.\n\x7f\nCustom pricing based on usage and deployment model\n\x7f\nAll NexaAI products included\n\x7f\nOn-premise or private cloud deployment\n\x7f\nDedicated customer success manager\n\x7f\n24x7 support with SLA\n\x7f\nQuarterly security and compliance reviews\nBilling & Discounts'), Document(id='9a2113e8-f16f-4fbd-9bef-770dbf1f0dbc', metadata={'producer': 'ReportLab PDF Library - www.reportlab.com', 'page_label': '1', 'author': '(anonymous)', 'creator': '(unspecified)', 'page': 0, 'moddate': '2026-02-14T13:07:17+00:00', 'title': '(anonymous)', 'subject': '(unspecified)', 'creationdate': '2026-02-14T13:07:17+00:00', 'source': 'D:\\AI\\RAG\\11_self_rag\\documents\\Company_Profile.pdf', 'trapped': '/False', 'keywords': '', 'total_pages': 2}, page_content='NexaAI Solutions – Company Profile\nCompany Overview\nNexaAI Solutions Pvt. Ltd. is a business-focused artificial intelligence company founded in 2021.\nThe company specializes in building enterprise-ready AI systems for knowledge management,\nanalytics, and automation.\nNexaAI primarily serves mid-sized and large organizations across technology, finance, healthcare,\nand education sectors.\n\x7f\nFounded: 2021\n\x7f\nHeadquarters: Bengaluru, India\n\x7f\nEmployees: 85+\n\x7f\nOperating Regions: India, Southeast Asia, Europe\nVision'), Document(id='e1c9622e-888a-4ecc-aecc-b5b1c2755b01', metadata={'moddate': '2026-02-14T13:10:37+00:00', 'author': '(anonymous)', 'page': 0, 'trapped': '/False', 'creationdate': '2026-02-14T13:10:37+00:00', 'total_pages': 4, 'producer': 'ReportLab PDF Library - www.reportlab.com', 'page_label': '1', 'source': 'D:\\AI\\RAG\\11_self_rag\\documents\\Product_and_Pricing.pdf', 'subject': '(unspecified)', 'title': '(anonymous)', 'keywords': '', 'creator': '(unspecified)'}, page_content='NexaAI Solutions – Products & Pricing\nProduct Portfolio Overview\nNexaAI offers a modular suite of enterprise AI products designed to help organizations manage\nknowledge, analyze business data, automate customer interactions, and enforce AI governance.\nEach product can be used independently or deployed as part of an integrated AI platform.\nNexaChat – Internal Knowledge Assistant\nNexaChat is an AI-powered internal assistant that allows employees to query company documents,\npolicies, reports, and knowledge bases using natural language.')]
